{"server":"tw","storyId":"act11d0_level_act11d0_04_end","groupId":"act11d0","stageId":"act11d0_04","title":"復仇之魂","storyCode":"TW-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"73e6d6a9b9e79172c2a16798f3ca55f9a0f5aa8ba0abc8eaf616e822fe654eac","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"得知安托之死而陷入焦慮的亞葉，被鈴蘭說服，兩人開始為了尋找冬靈人相關的線索東奔西走。與此同時，灰喉等人也遭遇了武裝感染者的領袖：整合運動，泥岩。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"九尾狐活动 4下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"媽媽？媽媽，你要去哪裡？\n去高地？滿是鮮花的高地？\n......害了爸爸的壞人就在那裡？那媽媽會懲罰他嗎？\n那懲罰他能讓爸爸回來嗎？\n......不能？\n那......那我不要媽媽去了。\n不去不行？可我不想媽媽回去烏薩斯......那裡的麵包太硬了，冬天很冷......\n媽媽？\n媽媽......\n......\n......\n......媽媽再也沒有回來。\n我用媽媽留下的錢，繼續在烏薩斯讀書，生活。\n一個人。\n一個人等待了好幾年。一個人生活了好幾年。\n直到凱爾希醫生出現在我的面前，她說，她是研究所的所長，她來接我了。\n那時凱爾希醫生很疲憊，比現在還要疲憊，後來我才知道，她剛從某個遙遠的地方回到這裡，找到了我。\n然後，我加入了羅德島。\n我問過凱爾希醫生，媽媽去哪兒了。凱爾希醫生沒有說太多，她只告訴我，媽媽和爸爸一同，被埋葬在烏薩斯的深處。\n她是我最尊敬的老師，最憧憬的領袖，她指導我，教育我，不僅在語言上，更靠著無數幹員的所作所為感染著我。\n但凱爾希醫生她......她唯獨沒有回答我那個最簡單的問題——\n我該向什麼復仇？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......小麗薩，你其實可以不用跟過來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"我不放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"這沒什麼......只是去那附近搜查一下，也許會有那支武裝感染者隊伍的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐......你覺得他們會是元兇嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不確定——出於理性，“不確定”是當然的回答，畢竟我們沒有證據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"但考慮到城鎮現在的情況，他們是最值得懷疑的對象，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"還有冬靈，塞弗林怎麼也不肯多說，雖然不知道這意味著什麼......但既然串通感染者隊伍，那就是一路貨色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"這附近的山脈叫做冬靈山脈，常年被冰雪覆蓋的荒蕪山脈......有什麼聯繫嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道這些，我只知道，我要揪出兇手，然後從他那裡得到一個答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐，你從昨天開始就一直......很嚇人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"麗薩......對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":".......不是每個人都能那麼簡單釋然的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"這種不辭而別已經是第二次了......至少這次，我不願意再後悔了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"出來吧，我沒有敵意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"我還覺得自己潛伏的技術很不錯......你是怎麼發現我們的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......直覺？大概吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗚啊，總感覺這傢伙很難對付啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"（那你就少說兩句。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我翻閱過羅德島的一些戰鬥記錄，你不是普通的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......羅德島？是這樣，你們是......羅德島的幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦？要動手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"現在灰喉不在......但至少我們得拖住他的腳步！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"——別緊張，別攻擊他！卡達！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"不要輕舉妄動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！抱、抱歉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......？一瞬間，你的瞳孔變得鮮紅，這是某種應激反應嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......是我嚇到你了嗎？抱歉，我只是想讓你們知道......戰鬥是徒勞的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們是沃倫姆德的居民......你們最好離開這裡，很危險。憤怒的冬靈人或是感染者遇到你們......你們凶多吉少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......多謝忠告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你為什麼出現在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是來獻一束花，之後我自會離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......你手裡捧著的，只是普通的野花？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的秋天很冷，我時常做夢的......夢見這些花，這些花就像是那座雪山的孩子......冰涼涼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......願逝者安息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"（他真的只是來祈禱的？該不會是假裝獻花其實在釋放什麼源石技藝吧？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"（看不清他的表情就判斷不出他是不是在說謊，但是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"（......他好像真的很傷心。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"不許動，不要轉身，舉起手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼時候出現的，竟然這麼輕巧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧，羅德島的弩手，你的弩箭奈何不了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"不要動，我只是有話想問問——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"不展露力量的對話......毫無意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"——頑冥不化！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"看，我捏住了你的箭......你傷不到我分毫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"他舉起了一塊岩石擋住了弩箭！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不對！是源石技藝！他確實“捏住了”箭矢，用泥土！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"——是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"至少......你也沒有在出聲警告之前就先放冷箭，我討厭偷襲，不過你並不讓人討厭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"而且.....嗯，如果你剛才的第二支箭上弦了......會怎樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"那要取決於你是否來得及在脖頸處用源石技藝防禦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......雖然不一定來得及，但是這套護甲可是很厚實的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，既然你無意死鬥，那再好不過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以離開了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，好像還不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......也是，唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然有各種各樣的萊塔尼亞人加入了我們，隊伍變得豐富多樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"但......作為弩手的你是不會看漏這個標誌的。這個，過去屬於感染者的標誌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動點亮了一團野火，過去、現在、將來，它都將在大地的各個角落生生不息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，整合運動這個詞並不代表所有感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你呢？你是萊塔尼亞本地的響應者，還是背負著罪惡和陰謀，從別處逃來這裡的流亡者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"我......？唔......都算吧，從卡茲戴爾開始的漫無目的的旅途，我們一直在逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......沃倫姆德已經是一團亂麻了，我不認為這和你們毫無關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"的確，怎麼會毫無關係呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"但我......也不是整合運動，不再是了，我只是泥岩小隊的隊長，一個......雇傭兵？不，只是一個感染者吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"（他怎麼老是像在自言自語一樣？那什麼整合運動的思維都這麼跳脫嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"（在行動隊長進行交涉的時候麻煩你安靜一點，如果你實在沒事幹，可以錄影記錄。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"（對哦！打開相機打開相機......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，說的也是啊......我是什麼呢，我不再是雇傭兵了，不再是整合運動了，事到如今，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，施術的餘波好像把花朵弄髒了......這個季節，好不容易採到的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你有意戰鬥，能換個地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"真是遊刃有餘的說法......不過，免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"卡達，斷崖，不要放鬆警惕，但也不要攻擊他，給他點空間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"——我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......這場火災，我們的幹員似乎被捲進去了，我需要情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉......但我們也有四名同伴在這場火災中喪生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們對偵探之類的東西一竅不通......但我們之中有很多萊塔尼亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都接受過系統的教育，比起其他國家的民眾，他們是天生的術師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"至少......我可以斷定，這是人禍，絕非意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"誰下的手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們知道，那麼這座城鎮會因為那個人的死而重回平靜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"你還知道些什麼？比如，你剛才說了冬靈人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也許誤會了，我無心與你為敵，也只是來祭奠同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"但也許有一天，我們會兵戈相向，我沒有信任你們的......理由。也不會和你們分享太多資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......原來如此，但是沒關係，你的態度已經可以起到很大的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你去過鎮裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"一片混亂，感染者們起來抗議，與非感染者們發生衝突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"是你的人在教唆他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......這很不好，很多無辜的人因此受罪......但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......但在沃倫姆德認罪之前，在他們把兇手交出來之前，沒有人會讓步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"我要用什麼理由阻止那些因為同伴的枉死而憤怒的感染者......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"——聽起來，事情並非全部在你掌握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......越來越多的人被捲進去，遲早，我們也會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們的身份不便於走動，但是你們可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我們已經說了夠多了，我並不能完全信任你們，羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不能夠信任，那麼就這樣吧......再會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉姐！那個傢伙好可怕！比羅德島上的那幾隻大菲林還要可怕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"至少他沒有表露出很強的攻擊性。但如果他確實有一整支小隊的話......現在的沃倫姆德毫無還手之力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"就這麼讓他走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"正面衝突不是好選擇，過度刺激對方會讓沃倫姆德陷入困境。而且現在還確認不了安托的下落......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果連整合運動都出現在這裡，事情就麻煩多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"有聯繫上亞葉幹員和鈴蘭幹員嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，城內太混亂了，我甚至猶豫是否該以羅德島的官方身份去拜訪議事廳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我也發現了一些讓人在意的事情，這似乎並不是常見的感染者衝突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"的確，萊塔尼亞對待感染者向來溫和，如果沒有其他因素，事情不至於走到這一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"“冬靈”是個重要的線索，我們可能得繼續調查下去。斷崖和我走，卡達，麻煩你偵查一下他們的駐紮地點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要掌握他們的隊伍規模，以及他們的行動模式，只用看一眼就好，小心為上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，早知道這樣還不如陪萊恩哈特在宿舍裡玩石頭......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"哼哼——♪哼哼哼——♪\n冬靈啊，冬靈♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"冬靈？你們從哪兒聽說這個詞的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是什麼人？羅德島？外來者不要摻和那麼多，這不關你們什麼事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"——我不知道什麼冬靈，不要和我搭話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"冬靈？調查？不，沃倫姆德早就沒有冬靈人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......早就沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我的意思是......唉，我就不該理你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著，我不管你們想幹什麼，但是沃倫姆德是個比你們想像中還要團結的城鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"也許大部分人連這個規矩都不會告訴你們，但我可以破例給你們解釋——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"“冬靈人”是沃倫姆德歷史的一部分，但這個話題會激起不必要的爭端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看來，現在已經因為“冬靈人”引起了相當麻煩的爭端了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是說前天動力爐被毀的事情？比起這個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"即使這會讓沃倫姆德在深冬停滯在這片荒涼的土地上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"天災讓沃倫姆德損失很多，這個冬天不會好過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......外來者，不要得寸進尺。這個話題是貴族老爺們最忌諱提起的事情，我不想找麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的想知道冬靈人是什麼，就去自己問問冬靈人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"誒......不知道冬靈是什麼的話要怎麼找到冬靈......不講理嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"——夠了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你們自己想辦法吧，我不知道，我什麼都不知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"走掉了......真是過分的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......團結的城鎮？可真是團結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我們還是該去問問塞弗林長官......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這是重要的突破口，希望他不要像上次那樣逃避話題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是太陽已經要下山了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"*烏薩斯粗口*！為什麼今天也一無所獲——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐，不要著急......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有......！我只是，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......這裡有什麼不對勁......我知道的......但是安托她......我到底要怎麼辦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......要怎麼辦，媽媽......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哼哼——♪哼哼哼——♪\n那是一節易折的樹枝♪\n冬靈啊，冬靈♪\n倦於長久的生和長久的死♪\n它頑強堅韌地唱它的歌♪\n唱了一個夏天♪\n一個冬天之久♪\n冬靈啊，冬靈♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_294_ayer","aliases":["斷崖"]},{"speakerId":"char_328_cammou","aliases":["卡達"]},{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亞葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_358_lisa","aliases":["鈴蘭"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["灰喉"]}]}
